{"text": "I need to find all numbers divisible by 3 and sum them.\n\nA number is divisible by 3 if the sum of its digits is divisible by 3. Let me check each number:\n\n**Numbers divisible by 3:**\n- 57: 5+7=12 \u2713\n- 504: 5+0+4=9 \u2713\n- -882: 8+8+2=18 \u2713\n- 555: 5+5+5=15 \u2713\n- 42: 4+2=6 \u2713\n- 423: 4+2+3=9 \u2713\n- -321: 3+2+1=6 \u2713\n- 663: 6+6+3=15 \u2713\n- 852: 8+5+2=15 \u2713\n- 582: 5+8+2=15 \u2713\n- -774: 7+7+4=18 \u2713\n- 6: 6 \u2713\n- -27: 2+7=9 \u2713\n- 405: 4+0+5=9 \u2713\n- -339: 3+3+9=15 \u2713\n- -24: 2+4=6 \u2713\n- 561: 5+6+1=12 \u2713\n- 288: 2+8+8=18 \u2713\n- -480: 4+8+0=12 \u2713\n- -612: 6+1+2=9 \u2713\n\n**Sum calculation:**\n57 + 504 + (-882) + 555 + 42 + 423 + (-321) + 663 + 852 + 582 + (-774) + 6 + (-27) + 405 + (-339) + (-24) + 561 + 288 + (-480) + (-612)\n\n= (57 + 504 + 555 + 42 + 423 + 663 + 852 + 582 + 6 + 405 + 561 + 288) + (-882 - 321 - 774 - 27 - 339 - 24 - 480 - 612)\n\n= 4938 + (-3459)\n\n= 1479\n\n**ANSWER: 1479**", "usage": {"calls": 1, "input_tokens": 1026, "output_tokens": 4019, "cost_usd": 0.021121, "latency_s": 28.471076250076294}, "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "stop_reason": "end_turn"}